                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout><p>The text is set out over three lines filling the upper half of the front face of the block. The lines get very slightly larger from line 1 to line 3, with an initial vacat of 4-5 cm, and a less regular line-end.</p>
                                    <rs ana="#execution.chiselled" ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1">chiselled</rs>
